  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3202.19 On-demand sticker",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3202.19 “On-demand sticker” means an official inspection sticker whose informational insert is printed on the VIR at the time that an inspection has demonstrated compliance with some or all applicable inspection laws and rules.\n\nSource. #12196, eff 10-1-17; renumbered by #13920 (formerly Saf-C 3202.18)",
